    "long_instructions": "## Test and Trust\r\nGoal: Test your model for real users. Write when people should and should not trust it.\r\n\r\nMove your Data Scientist to each stop as you start it. Click the zoom **+** in the bottom corner of the map.\r\n- **Try Stop 1:**\r\n    - a. Drag your two users into the User column.\r\n    - b. Copy each user's categories and prediction from **Test for My User** in your guide.\r\n    - c. Drag a ✓ or ✗ into Right?\r\n- **Try Stop 2:**\r\n    - a. Open your **Backpack**. Click **+** next to each user's tree (the files end in **fixed-tree**).\r\n    - b. Drag each tree into the Try Stop 2 box. Drag a corner to make it bigger.\r\n    - c. Drag each user's name to the spot on the tree where their prediction ends.\r\n    - d. If a prediction was wrong, finish \"It went wrong at …\"\r\n- **Try Stop 3:** Answer the Name and Zoom Out questions.\r\n- **Try Stop 4:** Write your draft model card.\r\n\r\nYou are done when Try Stops 1–4 have an answer.",
